  "content": "\n\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/d6e0a8f200546ab339f8f6ca25d199f0.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"524\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ZyNGZr4E2u\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/879788820265074698?color=F7F3F5&labelColor=030B14&style=for-the-badge&logo=Discord&label=Discord&logoColor=ff96c5\" alt=\"\" width=\"194\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"https://github.com/cojalexandru/pickable-orbs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/PICKABLEORBS-GitHub?color=F7F3F5&labelColor=030B14&style=for-the-badge&logo=GitHub&label=GitHub&logoColor=ff96c5\" alt=\"\" width=\"214\" height=\"28\"></a><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdecursio-team-1.gitbook.io%252fwiki%252fmods%252fpickable-health-orbs\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Wiki-PickableOrbs-F7F3F5?labelColor=030B14&style=for-the-badge\" alt=\"\" width=\"180\" height=\"28\"></a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/5b267057e5289aa3818c50860385b947.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1044\" height=\"58\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">總覽</span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">&nbsp;我們，<strong>The Decursio Team</strong>，今天要向大家介紹我們早期的作品之一——<strong><em>Pickable Health Orbs！</em></strong>這是一款 RPG 風格的模組，添加了可由特定生物或方塊掉落的球體。拾取這些球體後，將為您提供各種增益效果，例如即時治療與其他藥水效果。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">如果您是整合包開發者，可能會很高興地得知：與其他模組不同，本模組使用實體來生成這些球體。這意味著玩家無法將球體拾起並留待日後使用的狀況不會發生。不過，如果您確實對上述行為感興趣，請知悉：從未來的某個版本開始，將支援拾取並儲存球體供日後使用（視設定而定）。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/5b267057e5289aa3818c50860385b947.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1044\" height=\"58\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">功能特色</span></strong></em></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">本模組<b><i>高度可設定</i></b>。這表示您可以透過模組的設定檔新增或移除任何您想要的球體。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">此外，您還可以自訂每個球體的掉落機率、由哪些生物掉落、效果持續時間、效果強度等參數。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">預設情況下，本模組包含 8 種可拾取的球體。讓我們一一來看：</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- <i><strong>治療（Healing）：</strong></i>拾取後會為玩家恢復固定數量的生命值（數值可自訂）</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">-&nbsp;<i><strong>中毒（Poisonous）：</strong></i>預設施加 5 秒的中毒效果</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- <i><strong>傷害（Damaging）：</strong></i>主要對應原版 Minecraft 的「瞬間傷害」效果——會造成兩顆心的傷害</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- <i><strong>躍動（Jumping）：</strong></i>預設施加 5 秒的跳躍力提升效果</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- <i><strong>疾速（Speedster）：</strong></i>施加 5 秒的速度提升效果</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- <i><strong>迷惑（Confusion）：</strong></i>施加 5 秒的失明效果</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- <i><strong>漂浮（Levitation）：</strong></i>使玩家漂浮 5 秒</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">- <i><strong>火焰抗性（Fire Resistance）：</strong></i>提供 5 秒的火焰抗性效果</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">再次強調，上述所有數值均可透過模組設定檔進行修改，檔案位置位於 <strong><em>instance/config/pickableorbs/orbs</em></strong>。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/5b267057e5289aa3818c50860385b947.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1044\" height=\"58\"></strong></span></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><strong>圖片展示</strong></span></em></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/441/145/1lbkvw9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"627\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/441/146/gj0zlc8.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"627\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/441/147/2022-03-17_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"628\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/441/148/2022-03-17_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"627\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/441/149/2022-03-17_10.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"628\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/5b267057e5289aa3818c50860385b947.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1044\" height=\"58\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em><strong>我們的其它作品</strong></em></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>The Decursio Project: Expert</strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">靈感來自 Sevtech:Ages 與 Enigmatica 2:Expert 的專家模式風格整合包。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/decursio-project\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/DecursioProject/BH_DP_Header.png\" width=\"1041\" height=\"347\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>Simply Wooden Armor</strong></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">一款簡單的模組，還原了過去每款整合包初期都會附帶的舊版木甲。</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/simply-wooden-armor\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/050a47c2de15f4f1c9f55c40eccc15da.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"511\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>Sanguine Arsenal</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">外掛於 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/eidolon#:~:text=Eidolon%20is%20a%20magic%20mod,around%20necromancy%20and%20soul%20manipulation.\" rel=\"nofollow\"><strong>Eidolon</strong></a> 模組，著重於戰鬥系統及其他風格化功能。</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/sanguine-arsenal\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/71e0748d7cae56fc661bc49f48570b03.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1115\" height=\"511\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/remastered-projecte\" rel=\"nofollow\">ProjectE Remastered Armory</a></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">一款外觀模組，為 ProjectE 的裝備增添了全新的盔甲模型。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://i.gyazo.com/5b267057e5289aa3818c50860385b947.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1044\" height=\"58\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><strong><em>短片展示</em></strong></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">本模組曾出現在 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/pwrdownyt/projects\" rel=\"nofollow\">PwrDown</a> 於 <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCYyRRWyMLSMCfKiIvfWYvkw\" rel=\"nofollow\">YouTube</a> 發布的最新影片之一中。您可以在 8:10 處看到 Pickable Health Orbs 的實機畫面。</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/926tcazSPNY?wmode=transparent\" width=\"638\" height=\"358\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
